title: "kitchen-pos-blueprint: build a restaurant POS and replicate it to other businesses, a Claude skill"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Gargrish
    given-names: Amber
    website: "https://gargrish.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ambergargrish-ca/kitchen-pos-blueprint"
abstract: >-
  A Claude skill for building a production-grade, multi-tenant restaurant POS (tabs,
  kitchen display, online and QR ordering, payments, card terminals, offline mode,
  back office) and replicating it to salons, clinics, gyms and shops by configuration.
  Includes a 234-case edge-case catalog with a CI gate, a reference money core with
  tests, a starter schema and region tax notes for New Zealand and Canada. Built and
  proven on the Mainpoint platform (Platepoint, Orbyt).
